      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "If you have earlier logged in with Steam, your name is already registered in VRChat server. This is already known problem and there is no solution.\nSo you should logout, switch to VRChat login side, and choose another name, slight modified from Steam name. You may use spaces and _ character. Add something behind your name. Then you will login fresh in. \nNext time you login in, it will use VRChat side unless you have switched back to Steam login side.\n\nThe chance someone got your name is also possible, since there are million users in VRChat. Get another name.",
      "viewerReactions": null
